    <article>
      <h3>Pegasystems</h3>
      <p class="post-date">Principal Product Manager, User Experience · March 2016 – March 2025</p>
      <p>Played a key leadership role in shaping the strategic vision and launch of Pega Infinity Constellation, Pega’s next-gen SaaS (cloud-based) AI decisioning and workflow automation platform delivering out-of-the-box user experiences and low-code authoring. Translated customer pain points into actionable product strategy, aligning cross-functional teams and driving early adoption. Widely recognized across the company as the voice of the customer, consistently advocating for client needs and influencing product direction.</p>
      <h4>Key Achievements</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Led the first external customer production rollouts of Constellation, initiating the effort and partnering with Consulting and GTM teams to validate the platform in real-world conditions.</li>
        <li>Sought-after speaker at global events for clients, partners, and colleagues; known for presenting Constellation’s strategy and business value, and for evangelizing Pega’s vision for UX and low-code authoring.</li>
        <li>Co-led the Constellation early adopter program and Client Advisory Boards (CABs), partnering with GTM colleagues to accelerate adoption and gather critical feedback from initial customers.</li>
        <li>Championed customer needs across functional domains—including data integration, authoring, and case management—serving as the primary advocate for ensuring Constellation delivered a cohesive user experience.</li>
        <li>Authored core sales, marketing, and technical enablement materials to communicate business value.</li>
        <li>Initiated and led early development of tooling to support app migration from legacy architecture to Constellation, laying the foundation for future adoption.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="post-date">Senior Product Manager, User Experience</p>
      <p>Helped evolve Pega’s traditional UI technology (Cosmos and UI-Kit) by delivering responsive UX, enhanced accessibility, and templated out-of-the-box experiences—accelerating time to value, reducing technical debt, and simplifying future UI upgrades.</p>
      <p class="post-date">Senior Front-end Developer</p>
      <p>First front-end hire for new team to drive Pega’s traditional out-of-the-box UX and theming features. Served as lead developer while helping recruit and shape the team.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
