      <p>UI Lead for IBM Customer Experience Analytics, a SaaS platform delivering insights into customer journeys across channels.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Developed the project using an NPM-based environment, incorporating modern JavaScript frameworks and task automation tools like Angular, Bootstrap, and Gulp.</li>
        <li>Co-architected a feature enabling near real-time notifications for report generation progress using HTML5 WebSockets.</li>
        <li>Mentored and ramped up a new team of front-end developers for the product’s first release.</li>
